rolling updates means updating the images to the newer version without experiencing downtime to the customers
in a rolling update, old pods r replaced with new pods gradually,without stopping the whole app.
  step by step
  suppose when ur deployment has 3 pods
  created one new pod with the new version
  wait until the new pod becomes running
  deletes one old pod
  again creates another new pod
  repeats the process until all old pods r replaced
  so at every moment some pods stay available to users

what rollback does
  no full downtime
  app stays available
  safer upgrading/updates
  easy rollback if new pods fail
